WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Welcome to the presentation.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Why do we need to be fast?

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Consider how many events arrive each second.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
Efficient reconstruction helps us keep up.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Now let's return to finding tracks.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
We can represent the tracking problem as a graph.
